      "status": "awaiting-author-decision",
      "local": "An x axis starts at 0 meters and ends at 12 meters. There are four points on the graph with displacement paths. Path A starts at 0 and stops at 7. Path B starts at 12 and ends at 7. Path C starts at 2, goes to 10, turns around and goes back to 8, then turns around again and stops at 11. Path D starts at 9, goes to 3, then turns around and stops at 5.",
      "upstream": "An x axis starts at 0 meters and ends at 12 meters. There are four points on the graph with position paths. Path A starts at 0 and stops at 7. Path B starts at 12 and ends at 7. Path C starts at 2, goes to 10, turns around and goes back to 8, then turns around again and stops at 10. Path D starts at 9, goes to 3, then turns around and stops at 5.",
      "exercise_context": true,
      "credit_review_required": false,
      "disposition_reason": "BR02: retain local C endpoint and answer. Pinned upstream image ends at 10 m, but its solution calculates using 11 m. Axis-label-only repair is pending."
    },
